.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_OPEN 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_open
.Nd open a vnode for I/O
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_open "struct vnode *vp" "int mode" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn vop_open
wrapper checks access permissions for
.Fa vp ,
delegates open initialization to the filesystem-specific
.Va vop_open
callback when present, and updates vnode open counters used by the VFS core.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The function returns 0 on success, or an error number on failure.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EACCES
The requested open mode is not permitted by vnode access policy.
.It Bq Er EOPNOTSUPP
The underlying filesystem rejects open.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_access 9 ,
.Xr vop_close 9
